1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,136
Do ducks have elbows?

2
00:00:02,136 --> 00:00:03,392
What do you think?

3
00:00:05,392 --> 00:00:07,368
No! But I have wings!

4
00:00:07,368 --> 00:00:08,027
Ah...

5
00:00:08,277 --> 00:00:09,368
ah... choo!

6
00:00:09,368 --> 00:00:10,614
Into my wing!

7
00:00:10,614 --> 00:00:11,315
Quack!

8
00:00:13,165 --> 00:00:13,996
Hee hee!

9
00:00:13,996 --> 00:00:16,866
Dotty sneezes into her fluffy wing!

10
00:00:17,416 --> 00:00:19,781
Let's sing the Achoo Song!

11
00:00:20,031 --> 00:00:22,301
Do the actions with us!

12
00:00:24,601 --> 00:00:25,903
Hat on my head,

13
00:00:25,903 --> 00:00:27,351
my scarf is blue.

14
00:00:27,601 --> 00:00:30,005
Two yellow mittens, I'm cosy!

15
00:00:30,255 --> 00:00:31,312
Are you?

16
00:00:32,512 --> 00:00:34,413
When my nose is tickly,

17
00:00:34,413 --> 00:00:35,583
what do I do?

18
00:00:36,133 --> 00:00:37,411
Lift my elbow!

19
00:00:37,411 --> 00:00:38,614
Achoo, achoo!

20
00:00:41,314 --> 00:00:42,479
Achoo, achoo,

21
00:00:42,479 --> 00:00:43,718
into my elbow!

22
00:00:43,968 --> 00:00:45,600
A tissue for my nose,

23
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:46,756
and off we go!

24
00:00:47,356 --> 00:00:48,544
Wash, wash,

25
00:00:48,544 --> 00:00:49,902
wash my paws,

26
00:00:49,902 --> 00:00:51,260
count to ten!

27
00:00:51,510 --> 00:00:54,510
Now we're cosy friends again!

28
00:00:56,810 --> 00:00:59,252
Woof! Great singing, friends!

29
00:00:59,802 --> 00:01:01,507
Share with a friend and

30
00:01:01,507 --> 00:01:03,670
subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

31
00:01:04,170 --> 00:01:05,738
Watch the full story

32
00:01:05,738 --> 00:01:07,307
on Honey Bunny Kidz!
